	(text "A2B SUB-NODE (2026-10-23, per Peter): U6 AD2428, bus-powered (AD242x DS Fig. 36; coupling per EVAL-AD2428WD1BZ sheet 2)\nA side J7 (from AeroNode or previous cup): line+ -> L3 -> V_NODE -> D1 -> VIN_CUP; line- -> L4 -> GND (this cup's ground is the recovered bus bias).\nB side J8 (to next cup, unused on the last cup): V_NODE -> R12 -> Q1 (gate: SWP via R13) -> L5 -> line+; line- -> L6 -> VSSN. SENSE via R14.\nI2S: U6 is master. DTX0 -> I2S0_SDATAI (ADAU1861 in), DRX0 <- I2S0_SDATAO. I2C: U6 masters SDA/SCL at 1V8 (IOVDD = 1V8).\nK2: AudioBoard CTL_SPKR -> main IO7 -> GPIO-over-distance -> U6 IO7 -> K2_CTL -> Q2 -> U4/U5 LEDs (R7/R8 680R from VIN_CUP). Default off.\nPower from VIN_CUP (6.4-7.2 V with the AeroNode's 8 V bus): U7 TPS62161 -> 1V8; U8 ADP7118 -> 3V3_MIC; U9 ADP7118 -> VLED.\nEE-419: a bus-powered node's ground is offset from the AeroNode's - connect only floating signals (J5 is transformer-isolated, AC-coupled).\nBudget: docs/a2b-bus-power-budget.md - cup R VIN 6.44 V worst case on the 8 V bus (3.7 V min)."
		(at 475 285 0)
		(effects
			(font
				(size 1.524 1.524)
			)
		)
